<title>JAPAN: Maspro Denkoh -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Maspro Denkoh -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 16.08		vs	   15.63</p>
<p> Operating	    1.06		vs	  739    million</p>
<p> Current		1.09		vs	  793    million</p>
<p> Net		  500    million    vs	  360    million</p>
<p> EPS		   24.62 yen	  vs	   21.26 yen</p>
